Add TOK_ADDTABLE token to the userspace ipfw token list (sbin/ipfw/ipfw2.h).

The token is appended to the action token group, after TOK_SETMARK /
TOK_SKIPACTION / TOK_UDP_EIM, so it does not shift any existing values.

--- a/sbin/ipfw/ipfw2.h
+++ b/sbin/ipfw/ipfw2.h
@@ action token group @@
 	TOK_TCPSETMSS,
 	TOK_MARK,
 	TOK_SETMARK,
 	TOK_SKIPACTION,
 	TOK_UDP_EIM,
+	TOK_ADDTABLE,
